Deduplicate default llama.cpp devices in multi-accelerator builds: the
same physical GPU registers once per compiled ggml backend and memory
gets booked for every view. Views are matched by PCI bus id, the
native backend wins, an explicit device: option or LLAMA_ARG_DEVICE
overrides. Single-backend builds are unaffected. Proposed upstream.

